"""i3status-rs-ai-usage — AI subscription usage as an i3status-rust block.

Works with swaybar on sway and i3bar on i3.

Reports how much of your plan quota you have burned for:

  claude   Claude Pro / Max      (Anthropic OAuth usage endpoint)
  codex    ChatGPT Plus / Pro    (Codex CLI session rollout files)
  copilot  GitHub Copilot        (copilot_internal/user quota snapshots)

Two subcommands matter:

  render   print one line of i3status-rust `custom` JSON.  Never blocks:
           it reads a cache and forks a refresh in the background.
  poll     refresh the cache (this is the part that touches the network).

See README.md for the i3status-rust wiring.
"""

